# Frontend rules
- React 18 + TS strict, functional components, hooks only. One component per file, PascalCase.
- Styling: Tailwind + shadcn/ui. Dark mode default (control-room look), light mode supported via CSS variables.
- **Offline**: self-host fonts via `@fontsource/inter` and `@fontsource/jetbrains-mono` (npm packages bundled by Vite). No `<link>` to external hosts, no external images.
- Server state: TanStack Query. Live state (events, tracks, FPS): Zustand store fed by a single WebSocket client with auto-reconnect and backoff.
- Video: `<img src="/api/cameras/{id}/stream.mjpg">` plus a `<canvas>` overlay for boxes/skeletons drawn client-side from WS metadata (so overlays can be toggled without re-encoding).
- Every page needs loading, empty and error states. Accessible: keyboard navigation, aria labels, contrast AA.
- Severity colors (consistent everywhere): critical `red-500`, warning `amber-500`, info `sky-500`, ok `emerald-500`.
- Keep API types in `src/api/types.ts` mirroring `docs/05-API-SPEC.md`.
- Charts: Recharts only. Tables: TanStack Table. Icons: lucide-react.
